    "directions": [
      "In a kadai heat ghee then add bay leaf, cloves, green cardamom, black pepper cons and let them crackle.",
      "Then add the chicken and saute for a minute then add salt, ginger-garlic paste, green chilli and continue sauteing until the chicken is light brown.",
      "Now add coriander powder, degi red chilli powder, turmeric powder and saute them until fragrant.",
      "Then add the curd, brown onion paste and mix it properly then add water, stir it once and cover it with a lid and cook until then chicken is cooked completely.",
      "Remove the lid then add chopped coriander leaves and cover it again for a minute and switch off the flames.",
      "Serve hot in a serving bowl and garnish with coriander leaves."
    ],
